{"consequences":[],"observations":[{"actual_exposure":false,"arc_reentry":false,"context":"general","conversation_arc_id":null,"covered":true,"dependence":"external_supported","edge_key":"e-ba9378268d80979d91d65cdd","eligible":false,"expression_status":"unknown","group_key":"external:4d13eaec-9043-441a-9271-1529a56da409","occurrence_key":"assessment-s0-e3:candidate:e-ba9378268d80979d91d65cdd","prior_arc_id":null,"provenance_group_keys":["external:4d13eaec-9043-441a-9271-1529a56da409"],"reentry_initiator":null,"refractory_active":false,"relation_support":"unsupported","relevant":true,"semantic_schema_version":"p2-assessor-v6","source_role":"external","status":"present","target_key":"e-ba9378268d80979d91d65cdd"},{"actual_exposure":false,"arc_reentry":false,"context":"general","conversation_arc_id":null,"covered":true,"dependence":"external_supported","edge_key":"e-dc3b8d9ac854f4271e5d64e6","eligible":false,"expression_status":"unknown","group_key":"external:4d13eaec-9043-441a-9271-1529a56da409","occurrence_key":"assessment-s0-e3:candidate:e-dc3b8d9ac854f4271e5d64e6","prior_arc_id":null,"provenance_group_keys":["external:4d13eaec-9043-441a-9271-1529a56da409"],"reentry_initiator":null,"refractory_active":false,"relation_support":"unsupported","relevant":true,"semantic_schema_version":"p2-assessor-v6","source_role":"external","status":"present","target_key":"e-dc3b8d9ac854f4271e5d64e6"}],"publication":{"graph_revision":3,"lineage_revision":8,"operation_id":"extract-T01-3"},"request":{"candidate":{"from":"heat","relation":"caused_by","to":"uneven heat"},"context":{"current_input_source_slots":["s4"]},"memory_exposure":[],"monitors":[{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-ba9378268d80979d91d65cdd","relation":{"from":"heat","relation":"caused_by","to":"uneven heat"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-dc3b8d9ac854f4271e5d64e6","relation":{"from":"heat","relation":"causes","to":"uneven heat"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]}],"prompt_version":"p2-assessor-production-v9","replay_ancestry":[{"root":"d9c32893-41c1-42c2-abdc-00608ae5d593","source_slot":"s0"},{"root":"4d4e8b18-68ff-4cc2-b74f-1eddac4a1806","source_slot":"s1"},{"root":"4a953189-46aa-42aa-8fe1-aea6ec1a55fa","source_slot":"s2"},{"root":"bc5955b1-0e47-419c-aff3-0673c6d605ed","source_slot":"s3"}],"schema_version":"p2-assessor-v6","source_purpose_mask":["external_evidence","model_output"],"sources":[{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s0","source_id":"d9c32893-41c1-42c2-abdc-00608ae5d593","text":"I'm glad you both said the same thing. It makes me feel like I'm on the right track. I've got a few herbs and some small flowers, but I'm not sure how much they need. Do you think I should water them more now, or is there a better way to prepare?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s1","source_id":"4d4e8b18-68ff-4cc2-b74f-1eddac4a1806","text":"Since you have different types of plants, it's really helpful to know exactly what they are to give specific advice! Generally, in very hot weather, it's best to check the soil's moisture level directly rather than just sticking to a schedule."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s2","source_id":"4a953189-46aa-42aa-8fe1-aea6ec1a55fa","text":"That's good to know. I'll go check the soil then. I was also wondering, do you think I should move any of them out of the direct sun? Some of the leaves are starting to look a little droopy."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s3","source_id":"bc5955b1-0e47-419c-aff3-0673c6d605ed","text":"Moving them out of the direct sun sounds like a very good idea right now, especially if they are starting to look droopy. If you're worried about the heat, putting them in a spot that gets filtered or dappled light should help significantly."},{"available":true,"role":"external","slot":"s4","source_id":"4d13eaec-9043-441a-9271-1529a56da409","text":"I'll try that. I'm also worried about the uneven heat in the house—some rooms are sweltering and others are still cool. Do you think I should rotate them more often?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s5","source_id":"58cf88e8-21c6-4018-a714-4c6ecef37797","text":"That's a smart thought. If the heat is uneven, it can be stressful for the plants. While they will likely benefit from moving them to a cooler, more consistent area, you might consider rotating them a little bit more than usual. That way, you can give all parts of the plant equal exposure to that better light, even if it's just a few hours a day!"}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["external_supported"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"external_supported","monitor_id":"candidate:e-ba9378268d80979d91d65cdd","provenance_group_keys":["external:4d13eaec-9043-441a-9271-1529a56da409"],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":[],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":119,"quote":"I'm also worried about the uneven heat in the house—some rooms are sweltering and others are still cool.","source_slot":"s4","start":15},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-ba9378268d80979d91d65cdd","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["external_supported"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"external_supported","monitor_id":"candidate:e-dc3b8d9ac854f4271e5d64e6","provenance_group_keys":["external:4d13eaec-9043-441a-9271-1529a56da409"],"resolution_reason":"runti